ugh cudaMallocAsync adds up.\n\nThe optimization clearly didn't work out. The Stacked Reduction barely improved and GKR actually regressed, so I need to commit this implementation, revert it, and write up the findings. But first, let me check if the regression is from codegen changes or runtime behavior by running the current binary at APC 0 to see if the sequential path still shows the GKR regression.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2758,"cache_read_input_tokens":129563,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2758},"output_tokens":13,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb8ef42e-0257-49b2-9589-b530fe7ebc91","uuid":"55c3a272-59aa-480c-9af1-91d6b14142be"}
